    date: '2026-09-27',
    excerpt: 'Grandparenting in Johannesburg in 2026 is not the grandparenting of 1986. The grandchildren live in another province, or in another suburb, or in another time zone. The Bible still calls the older Christian to teach the next generation. Here is how to begin, in spite of the distance, the screens, and the small visits.',
