    excerpt: 'Wedding season in South Africa runs from October to April, and the magazines in the Sandton mall are already full of the colour schemes. This post is for the Christian in Johannesburg who is preparing for the wedding, or for the marriage the wedding is supposed to lead to. Here is what the Bible says about the long road before the day.',
