      <h2>What the Bible Says About the Workplace</h2>
      <p>Colossians 3:23 — <em>Whatever you do, work at it with all your heart, as working for the Lord.</em> Colossians 3:17 — <em>do it all in the name of the Lord Jesus.</em> 1 Corinthians 10:31 — <em>do it all for the glory of God.</em> Jeremiah 29:5-7 — <em>Seek the peace and prosperity of the city.</em> The lunch break is part of the workplace. The lunch break is also part of the vocation.</p>
      <h2>What the Bible Says About the Quiet Hour at Work</h2>
