    content: `
      <img src="/images/posts/gardening-spring-sandton.jpg" alt="A small Sandton back garden in early spring with a raised bed of newly planted tomato seedlings, a Bible on a garden bench in the background, warm Joburg afternoon light" class="w-full rounded-lg my-6" />
