      <p><strong>Isaiah 58:11</strong> — <em>The Lord will guide you always; he will satisfy your needs in a sun-scorched land and will strengthen your frame. You will be like a well-watered garden, like a spring whose waters never fail.</em></p>
      <p><strong>John 4:14</strong> — <em>But whoever drinks the water I give them will never thirst. The water that I give will become in them a spring of water welling up to eternal life.</em></p>
