      <p>The Christian in Sandton who has begun to garden knows that the watering of the garden is a small picture of the watering of the soul. The Christian knows that the watering of the soul is the Bible, the prayer, the Bible study, the church. The Christian knows that the watering is real. The Christian knows that the water is real.</p>
