      <p>The Christian in Johannesburg who is looking for a community has the right to know what to look for. The Christian in Johannesburg who is looking for a community has the right to ask questions before joining. The Christian in Johannesburg who is looking for a community is encouraged to be patient — finding the right community takes time.</p>
      <p>Here is what we have noticed, after ten years of running a Wednesday Bible study in Parkmore.</p>

