      <p>The Christian who does not yet have an in-person community can join an online Bible study. Our Wednesday Bible study in Parkmore has been meeting online since 2017, and we have had members from Sandton, Soweto, Randburg, Roodepoort, and Pretoria join from the West Rand, the East Rand, and even from other countries. The online Bible study is one of the ordinary means of grace that God has given in the 21st century.</p>

